      "title": {
        "en": "Mixed feedback on retail store and tanks"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Shopper reviews present contrasting opinions about the store environment. Several customers enjoy a clean shop floor, good supplies of flea treatments, and welcoming adoption events for rescue cats. Conversely, multiple visitors express serious concerns regarding aquatic hygiene, citing cloudy water and dead fish in display tanks, alongside delivery partner issues."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Dissatisfaction with staff communication"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Communication from store and salon personnel is a frequent source of client complaints. Disappointed pet owners describe contentious arguments with groomers regarding dog breed classifications, arbitrary handling fees, and refusals to honour manufacturer coupons. Several reviewers report rude phone interactions and an unhelpful customer service desk."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Contrasting experiences with salon stylists"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Opinions about store staff and groomers vary sharply depending on the employee encountered. Several pet parents praise dedicated stylists such as Cai and Annarose for attentive, high-quality haircuts on Poodles and Shih Tzus. However, other clients recount hostile encounters with grooming staff who refused pre-booked services or displayed argumentative attitudes."
      }
    }
  ],
